2026-11-07T05:53:34.5599795Z       "unmetReason": "Supporting scope and remaining gaps: Real evaluation preparation preserves the exact development case, source revision, audience, method/tools, question, route, model, and output limit across candidate and generic runs. Reauthorization blocks current policy-ceiling drift, while poisoned derived search text cannot replace the pinned evidence packet. Synthetic development setup does not establish held-out or requirement-level value. A real grant is present and the owner resolves the exact private source before preparation, then revocation through the sharing service makes direct resolution and both native worker admissions fail before provider transport. This is a bounded revocation regression, not private held-out evidence. Controlled native worker transport records two 503 attempts and one valid response for the candidate run; reloaded D1 generation stages and budget rows preserve each time, outcome, known or bounded-uncertain cost, tokens, retry, receipt, and final settlement. Owner attention, expert quality, and useful-value measurements remain null/unclaimed. Controlled native worker transport records two 503 attempts and one valid response for the generic run; reloaded D1 generation stages and budget rows preserve each time, outcome, known or bounded-uncertain cost, tokens, retry, receipt, and final settlement. Owner attention, expert quality, and useful-value measurements remain null/unclaimed. Requirement-level acceptance remains unproven.",
