2026-11-07T05:53:34.5692247Z       "requirement": "**BASE-OPS-005 — Audit.** Every destructive action and every automated action that reaches a user records the actor, or the feature that acted, and the time. Audit records survive deletion of what they describe.\n\n## Shared conformance duties\n\nSeeds cite each applicable Base id and write only their delta in their own contract. A Base conformance journey runs on the seed's own data; planned coverage is not evidence that a duty passes.\n\n-"
