2026-11-07T05:53:34.6403398Z       "status": "unproven",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6404505Z       "unmetReason": "No validated CI-run proof for this acceptance point: \"a browser journey builds a dashboard of three charts and a view, applies a date filter that changes every tile, and confirms a member with fewer grants sees lower counts and no restricted values.\"",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6405530Z       "supportingTests": [],
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6407919Z       "requirement": "#### DB-014 — Dashboards\n\n*Tier:* Core\n\n**Requirement.** A page can hold a dashboard: several charts (`DB-008`) and views (`DB-011`) arranged in a grid, with dashboard-wide filters such as a date range or a person that apply to every tile. Each tile computes over the reader's authorized records only (`DB-002`).\n\n**Acceptance.**\n1. a browser journey builds a dashboard of three charts and a view, applies a date filter that changes every tile, and confirms a member with fewer grants sees lower counts and no restricted values."
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6409695Z     },
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6409793Z     {
