2026-11-07T05:53:34.6703853Z       "unmetReason": "Real Okta, Entra ID, JumpCloud and Auth acceptance is not run. Default ADOPTED: Member role and name/email/groups only, Owner/guest/break-glass protection, hashed owner credentials; scoped admission cap applies to SCIM, while native invitation admission has no shared capacity guard.",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6704034Z       "supportingTests": [],
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6706792Z       "requirement": "#### ADMIN-002 — SCIM provisioning\n\n*Tier:* Core · *Cites:* BASE-SIGNIN-001 · *Register:* R-12\n\n**Requirement.** A SCIM 2.0 endpoint provisions users and groups from Okta, Entra ID, JumpCloud and Auth. Create invites the member. Update changes the name, email and groups (`WORK-009`). Deactivate runs `WORK-007` removal within 60 seconds, revoking sessions, tokens and devices. The bearer token is owner-generated, rotatable and stored hashed.\n\n**Acceptance.**\n1. a SCIM compliance run (Okta's SCIM test suite shape) creates, updates, pushes groups to and deactivates users, and asserts the resulting members, groups, revoked sessions and activity entries."
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6706906Z     },
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6707003Z     {
