2026-11-07T05:53:34.6708298Z       "supportingTests": [],
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6710903Z       "requirement": "#### ADMIN-005 — Audit export and SIEM streaming\n\n*Tier:* Core\n\n**Requirement.** Owners filter the workspace audit trail (`ACT-*`, including sign-ins, permission and sharing changes, exports, token use and admin settings) and export it as CSV or JSON. They can stream it to Splunk, Datadog or Microsoft Sentinel through a signed webhook (`API-002`), with a retention setting no shorter than one year.\n\n**Acceptance.**\n1. a Workers journey produces each audited action kind, exports it and finds every action with its actor, time and target, and streams it to a test receiver with valid signatures and no gaps after a receiver outage."
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6711023Z     },
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6711123Z     {
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6711232Z       "id": "ADMIN-006",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6711365Z       "document": "CONTRACT.md",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6711490Z       "status": "unproven",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6712615Z       "unmetReason": "No validated CI-run proof for this acceptance point: \"a browser journey restricts public publishing to owners, labels a container Confidential, and confirms that a member's publish attempt, an AI request over a confidential page and an export by a non-permitted member are each refused with a reason.\"",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6712738Z       "supportingTests": [],
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6715444Z       "requirement": "#### ADMIN-006 — Content governance\n\n*Tier:* Core\n\n**Requirement.** Owners decide who may create containers, publish publicly, invite guests, export and use AI. A container may carry a classification label, such as Confidential, that by default forbids public links and AI for its pages, and only a workspace owner can lift those defaults. Every governance change is recorded in activity.\n\n**Acceptance.**\n1. a browser journey restricts public publishing to owners, labels a container Confidential, and confirms that a member's publish attempt, an AI request over a confidential page and an export by a non-permitted member are each refused with a reason."
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6715669Z     },
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6715769Z     {
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6715886Z       "id": "ADMIN-007",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6716025Z       "document": "CONTRACT.md",
2026-11-07T05:53:34.6716139Z       "status": "unproven",
