target | partial | `src/core/features/claims/service.ts` | The cited material does not prove the complete revision, authority, audience and outcome journey for this capability under company policy; the held and all-autonomous cases remain unproven. Earlier implementation notes are retained in CHANGELOG.md. |\n| `KEEP-005` | Answers with current evidence and stated uncertainty | target | partial | `tests/flagship/intelligence/authority.test.ts` | The cited material does not prove the complete revision, authority, audience and outcome journey for this capability under company policy; the held and all-autonomous cases remain unproven. Earlier implementation notes are retained in CHANGELOG.md. |\n| `KEEP-006` | Checked runbooks | target | partial | `src/core/features/skills/routes.ts` | The cited material does not prove the complete revision, authority, audience and outcome journey for this capability under company policy; the held and all-autonomous cases remain unproven. Earlier implementation notes are retained in CHANGELOG.md. |\n| `KEEP-007` | Onboarding paths | target | missing | — | The cited material does not prove the complete revision, authority, audience and outcome journey for this capability under company policy; the held and all-autonomous cases remain unproven. Earlier implementation notes are retained in CHANGELOG.md. |\n| `KEEP-008` | Stale-knowledge sweeps | target | partial | `src/core/features/notifications/events.ts` | The cited material does not prove the complete revision, authority, audience and outcome journey for this capability under company policy; the held and all-autonomous cases remain unproven. Earlier implementation notes are retained in CHANGELOG.md. |\n| `KEEP-009` | Measured knowledge health | target | partial | `CONTRACT.md` — requirement text only; no validated CI-run proof. | The cited material does not prove the complete revision, authority, audience and outcome journey for this capability under company policy; the held and all-au